["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The charity that is also a time machine donor-advised fund (DAF) Schedule B chimera\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-complexsys-美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器-减税现在拿-捐钱以后再说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b98a243f0a884fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">27:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>美國的捐贈基金其實是個時間機器：減稅現在拿，捐錢以後再說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這是一套合法的「慈善時間機器」：把錢存進去立刻減稅，捐給誰、何時捐可以往後拖很多年——Anthropic員工未來的鉅額捐款很可能就走這條路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">慈善</span><span class=\"tag\">稅務</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Origins of Constantinople Tetrarchy Solidus Milion Notitia Hippodrome\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-ancients-罗马城早被废弃-君士坦丁堡只是把迁都做到了极致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83ea79d083d093bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬城早被廢棄，君士坦丁堡只是把遷都做到了極致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴克裡先以來，米蘭、尼科米底亞、特里爾早已分走羅馬的權力和宮廷；君士坦丁只是把這套遷都慣例做大、做永久，並冠上自己的名字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Arvind Krishna &amp; Nikesh Arora: Quantum Threat, Open vs Frontier AI, AI Cyber Warfare &amp; SaaS Collapse QBI (Quantum Benchmarking Initiative) logical qubit post-quantum cryptography ZDR (zero data retention) open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-allin-加密硬盘现在被偷-五年后也可能被量子计算机破解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2252b98cbb7fdf85-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>加密硬盤現在被偷，五年後也可能被量子計算機破解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">IBM和Palo Alto Networks的CEO說，量子計算機預計2030年前後就能破解今天的加密算法，而後量子密碼學方案早已現成，只是企業一直懶得換。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">密碼學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"716. King Arthur: The Truth Behind the Legend (Part 4) Historia Britonum dux bellorum Annales Cambriae Mirabilia Britanniae Y Gododdin cataphract\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-restishistory-亚瑟之名只流行于六七世纪-这是他存在的最强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c546eadef77e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>亞瑟之名只流行於六七世紀，這是他存在的最強證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現存證據沒有一條能單獨證明亞瑟真實存在，但「亞瑟」作為羅馬人名只在不列顛貴族間流行過六七世紀這一小段時間，這個空窗至今無人能解釋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀史</span><span class=\"tag\">史源考據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Can Dividend Investing Give You Yield AND Growth? yield trap free cash flow payout ratio net share issuance\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-mastersinbiz-股息不是收益率游戏-是识别哪家公司真能把现金还给你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5dd15b785a2d85d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>股息不是收益率遊戲，是識別哪家公司真能把現金還給你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">股息是現金，騙不了人；作者用自己在金融危機前以51美元賣出花旗的真實交易，說明高股息率常常是價格暴跌的假象，而非公司變好的信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">股息投資</span><span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cure to Founder Burnout Isn&#x27;t Rest | 6 Solo Founders swallow the frog chief of staff\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-solofounders-创始人倦怠的解药不是休息-而是重新找到动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18d01623f9e39d48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>創始人倦怠的解藥不是休息，而是重新找到動力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在Lindy熬了兩年多後，Flo以為自己需要半年假期才能恢復，但真正讓他走出倦怠的，是重新找到動力的那一刻，精力幾乎立刻就回來了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創始人倦怠</span><span class=\"tag\">獨自創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI lab staff: Has your project been overtaken by events? 8 strategic updates | Rob Wiblin RSI (recursive self-improvement) CoT monitoring Overton window eval awareness mech interp model organism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-eightythousand-ai员工能拖慢失控进程-但这份议价权正在快速清零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87b66f6770249f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">14:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>AI員工能拖慢失控進程，但這份議價權正在快速清零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技術員工能靠罷工式不配合為對齊研究拖出時間，但這種槓桿只在公司還離不開他們時成立——一旦模型自動化了他們的工作，這份權力就會歸零，所以能用就得現在用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Unearthed! in October 2026, Part 2 borrow pit maquette clinker-built\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-stuffmissed-中国壁画两千年不褪色-秘密是血液而非颜料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>中國壁畫兩千年不褪色，秘密是血液而非顏料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">左江花山岩畫兩千年保持鮮紅，科學分析發現顏料用石灰漿混血液作粘合劑，部分血液來自產後女性，可能帶有母系社會的儀式意味。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">沉船</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Infrastructure for AI Agents: Documents | Reducto’s Adit Abraham VLM IDP harness recall\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-a16z-大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错-是悄悄漏掉信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>大模型處理長文檔最容易犯的錯，是悄悄漏掉信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">權威基準測試發現，頂尖大模型抽取長文檔時精確率很高，但會不動聲色地漏掉信息，這種錯誤在生產環境裡幾乎無法被發現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文檔處理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Robinson on What It Looks Like When a State is Failing extractive institutions inclusive institutions creative destruction monopsony critical juncture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-oddlots-诺奖得主断言-中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>諾獎得主斷言：中國經濟遲早要為政治集權買單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他認為中國增長靠的是經濟從汲取性轉向包容性制度，但政治權力從未被制衡——權力導致腐敗、絕對權力導致絕對腐敗，這決定了增長終將脫軌，只是時間問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Broomology (BROOMS) with Cate O’Connell-Richards besom broomcorn johnny flying ointment broom squire Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-ologies-女巫飞天传说的真实来源-致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>女巫飛天傳說的真實來源：致幻藥膏塗在掃帚柄上使用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂女巫騎掃帚飛天，脫胎自她們把含致幻生物鹼的藥膏塗抹在掃帚柄上、經粘膜吸收產生的飛行幻覺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗史</span><span class=\"tag\">手工藝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI for the Fortune 2000: How Tenex Builds an AI-Native SDLC — Alex Lieberman &amp; CJ Hess MetaHarness FDE (forward deployed engineer) RBAC AMP Kill My SaaS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-latentspace-多数企业用上了ai聊天-但智能体真正投产的不到5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9a3ee5d13ee0cdf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>多數企業用上了AI聊天，但智能體真正投產的不到5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企業給員工裝上Claude和Codex很容易，90%已經做了；但把智能體真正部署進生產、幹非工程的活，只有5%做到——這中間的落差才是這期的核心數據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">按產出付薪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"155. 和科沃斯錢程聊，父與子、企二代接班的樣本與肌理、機器人，和我內心的追尋 physical AI FSD repetition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-zhangxiaojun-29岁当上科沃斯ceo-他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/655ca401e97f9e11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>29歲當上科沃斯CEO,他說那是愚昧之巔不是人生巔峰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他接任CEO時以為到達人生巔峰，後來才明白那是一次史詩級錯判：戰略方向全對，卻因為不懂公司怎麼做決策，兩三年都沒把自己和組織的神經接上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企二代接班</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#887: Q&amp;A with Tim — The 4-Hour Workweek in a World of AI, Rebuilding Personal Agency, The 4-Hour Body After 40, and More DEAL framework Oryx red teaming accelerated TMS vagal nerve stimulation Gymnastic Strength Training (GST)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-timferriss-ai不会省时间-只会把垃圾工作做得更快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>AI不會省時間，只會把垃圾工作做得更快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沒有先定義和砍掉該做的事，AI只是加速器：它不會創造閒暇，只會把瑣碎、無關緊要的任務放大成更多工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人效率</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Programmable Data Center — Evan Conrad, SF Compute physical settlement cash settlement basis risk order book backplane InfiniBand fabric\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-latentspace-英伟达造不出算力期货市场-因为做了就得放弃自己的推理生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74ca452fc18a3198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達造不出算力期貨市場：因為做了就得放棄自己的推理生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有手握算力供給的玩家都有自己的生意要保護，只有徹底放棄推理和雲業務、只做中立撮合的人，才能讓這個價格被所有人信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力交易</span><span class=\"tag\">物理結算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Marriott on the End of Reading Reading Revolution Republic of Letters ethnolinguistic fractionalization post-literate\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-goodfight-识字真正训练的不是知识-而是把情绪逐出说理的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>識字真正訓練的不是知識，而是把情緒逐出說理的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬里奧特認為，識字真正的作用是把魅力、情緒等非理性說服手段逐出公共說理；讀寫衰退，意味著靠人格和情緒煽動的政治正捲土重來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">閱讀衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">識字與民主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Gives Away 5% of Its Shares, Clone’s Muscle Robot, ElevenLabs Steals Podcaster&#x27;s Voice Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) McKibben muscle antagonistic actuation preference stack\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-twist-人形机器人新方案-水压人工肌肉造价只要电机拉线的十分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebb4c2b15536a9a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人新方案：水壓人工肌肉造價只要電機拉線的十分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Clone Robotics 不用電機拉線去模擬肌肉，而是給編織套管裡的彈性管加壓液體讓它直接收縮，CEO稱這套方案造價只要電機驅動人形機器人的十分之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人工肌肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A World Model of Life: Biohub&#x27;s Alex Rives on Virtual Cells, Measurement, &amp; the $1.8B Data Push ESM AlphaFold RLVR laser phase plate cryo-electron tomography organoids\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-cogrev-18亿美元押注的不是数据量-而是重新定义怎么-看见-细胞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c97e57b81c6b9f77-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>18億美元押注的不是數據量，而是重新定義怎麼「看見」細胞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alex Rives認為虛擬細胞模型多年做不出來，真正瓶頸不是算力或數據量不夠，而是我們對細胞內部能觀測到的東西太有限——測量能力才是模型的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">虛擬細胞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Has a Health Expert in Their Pocket? | OpenAI’s Karan Singhal Move 37 HealthBench Professional A1C EHR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-a16z-openai做医疗ai不走专科模型路线-赌的是通用模型会持续变强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI做醫療AI不走專科模型路線，賭的是通用模型會持續變強</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">專科醫療模型很快會被通用前沿模型甩開，OpenAI選擇把數百名醫生提供的專科數據訓練進每一代GPT裡，而不是單獨做一個醫療專用模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療AI</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"509 通往戰時陪都之路：盧作孚建設重慶北碚往事\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-cn2aa250-一个剿匪的民团-如何变成重庆工业化的发动机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>一個剿匪的民團，如何變成重慶工業化的發動機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">重慶後來的軍工基因不是抗戰才種下的：盧作孚把一個原本只管剿匪的團練局，改造成了修鐵路、開科學院的地方政府雛形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民國史</span><span class=\"tag\">地方自治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Beyond chores: How to teach kids to notice what needs to be done and share the mental load with Sam Kelly mental load noticing walk notice and do preexisting motivators dandelion effect\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-secureattach-真正该教孩子的不是做家务-而是-注意到-需要做什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>真正該教孩子的不是做家務，而是「注意到」需要做什麼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者花一年教會丈夫主動發現家務，卻驚覺自己仍在替孩子做「注意」這部分工作——這個代際循環，她決定從孩子這一代開始打破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理負荷</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Christina Cacioppo - Building an Enduring Software Company in the Age of AI - [Invest Like the Best, EP.496] FDE harness outcome pricing trust graph\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-ilt-vanta情愿倒贴ai成本-也不敢把token费用转嫁给客户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4850cdb6fa3385e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">57:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>Vanta情願倒貼AI成本，也不敢把token費用轉嫁給客戶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用戶精明到一眼能算出你在加價轉賣Claude的token,所以Vanta寧可自己吃成本、把更多客戶推進agent式使用，定價的事留到以後再解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SaaS定價</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CME&#x27;s Terry Duffy on the Disconcerting State of Finance Regulation self-certification perpetual futures funding rate core principle KYC 1256 tax treatment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-oddlots-芝商所ceo-两千五百份监管申报全部通过-一个没被拒绝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">29:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>芝商所CEO：兩千五百份監管申報全部通過，一個沒被拒絕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國商品期貨交易委員會近兩千五百份新產品申報無一被拒，連「大胃王吃幾個熱狗」都能過審——芝商所CEO Terry Duffy說這等於監管名存實亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融監管</span><span class=\"tag\">永續期貨</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Ep 225 Peptides: What your peptide dealer doesn’t want you to know GLP-1 compounding pharmacy 503A bulks list halo effect acromegaly\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-tpwky-fda换掉审查委员后-被警示有风险的肽类产品照样获批/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>FDA換掉審查委員後，被警示有風險的肽類產品照樣獲批</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學審查小組對七種流行肽類全票給出安全警示，但RFK換掉八名委員後的新班子幾乎全票放行，監管結論和政治任命之間的裂縫被擺上了檯面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肽類</span><span class=\"tag\">灰色市場</span>\n</div></div></a>"]